      "font size" : 10.909,
      "text color" : "[0.0]",
      "content" : "Lemma 3. Let G< be a marked Gro¨bner basis of I with regards to < and ω ∈ Rn≥0 be a weight vector on the boundary of the corresponding cone in G(I). The set",
